{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2021-12-13 07:00:00', 'title': 'SVB FINANCIAL GROUP ACQUIRES TECHNOLOGY EQUITY RESEARCH FIRM MOFFETTNATHANSON LLC', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., DEC. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SVB FINANCIAL GROUP ("SVB") (NASDAQ: SIVB), THE PARENT OF SILICON VALLEY BANK, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS\xa0CONTINUED\xa0EXPANSION\xa0INTO TECHNOLOGY INVESTMENT BANKING\xa0WITH THE\xa0ACQUISITION OF\xa0MOFFETTNATHANSON\xa0LLC, A NEW YORK-BASED INDEPENDENT SELL-SIDE RESEARCH FIRM KNOWN FOR ITS COVERAGE OF HIGH-GROWTH, DISRUPTIVE COMPANIES IN THE\xa0MEDIA, COMMUNICATIONS AND TECHNOLOGY\xa0SECTORS.'}